<title>NEW ZEALAND: Seafresh posts half-year profit, no div.</title>
<headline>Seafresh posts half-year profit, no div.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr result to March 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1.18 vs 0.23 loss</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 0.22 vs 0.39</p>
<p>    Turnover				   13.74 vs 6.96</p>
<p>    Abnormals after tax		     1.05 vs nil</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     0.19 vs 0.35 loss</p>
<p>    Tax					   0.06 vs 0.12</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	 66.00 vs 63.00</p>
<p>Note - Seafresh New Zealand Ltd is a fishing fleet operator.</p>
<p>Seafresh said the profit result included a NZ$1.5 million abnormal gain attributable to the allocation of new quota.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
